  "configuration_id": "config_030",
  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is that RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 and simple aggregation are much better than singleprofile RNA or image-only baselines, with avgpool and transformer nearly tied. This experiment keeps that promising RNA setting fixed and adds a simple concat fusion with the already-tested resnet50 image encoder, directly testing whether image information improves on the best RNA-only baseline. It is a minimal, high-value extension: if it helps, multimodal fusion is worth further exploration; if not, it shows resnet/concat fusion is not adding value before trying weighted fusion or stronger image encoders."
}

